 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Meera. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Meera, I am so frustrated. My current data plan is way too small and I keep hitting the limit every single month, which is costing me a fortune in overage charges!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you've been dealing with those overage charges. I can certainly help you find a plan that better fits your needs.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I just want something with more data so I don't have to worry about this anymore.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can definitely look into that for you. Before we access your account details, could you please provide your account number?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, it is 86037035. My name is Fatima Sharma.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Ms. Sharma. I see your current plan. I recommend our Unlimited Data Plan, which will stop those overage fees entirely.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "That sounds perfect. How much will that cost me per month?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "The new monthly price will be 55 dollars, and the change will take effect starting from your next billing cycle on October 1st.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "That is a fair price. Let's go ahead and do that. I also need to pay my current outstanding balance of 20 dollars first.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Of course. Please go ahead and provide the card details for that payment.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "It is four five three six six three zero six two six one one six nine five seven.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you. The payment has been processed successfully. I will now process the plan change and send a confirmation SMS to your phone number 94353 96017.",
      "tags": [
        "action:plan_change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Thank you so much, Meera. I feel much better now that this is sorted out.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You are very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? To recap, we have paid your balance and updated your plan to Unlimited. Have a wonderful day. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
